WEBVTT

00:00:12.753 --> 00:00:15.351
<v><b>Hannah:</b></v> Don’t you usually look before you cross the road?

00:00:15.514 --> 00:00:16.475
I nearly hit you.

00:00:16.476 --> 00:00:18.099
I didn’t see you until the last moment.

00:00:18.232 --> 00:00:22.297
<v><b>Jamie:</b></v> Sorry! Hey, Hannah, it’s me.

00:00:22.874 --> 00:00:23.534
It’s Jamie.

00:00:24.386 --> 00:00:29.238
<v><b>Hannah:</b></v> Jamie! What are you doing here? I nearly killed you!

00:00:30.287 --> 00:00:31.791
<v><b>Jamie:</b></v> I was buying something.

00:00:32.156 --> 00:00:34.448
I was in a hurry and I crossed the road without looking.

00:00:35.771 --> 00:00:36.467
<v><b>Hannah:</b></v> Come on.

00:00:36.748 --> 00:00:37.563
Get in!

00:00:48.598 --> 00:00:49.382
<v><b>Waiter:</b></v> Here you are.

00:00:50.393 --> 00:00:51.493
Two cappuccinos.

00:00:51.494 --> 00:00:52.339
<v><b>Hannah and Jamie:</b></v> Thanks.

00:00:55.116 --> 00:00:58.252
<v><b>Hannah:</b></v> What an evening! I nearly killed you.

00:00:58.758 --> 00:01:01.319
<v><b>Jamie:</b></v> Well, you didn’t kill me, so what’s the problem?

00:01:02.534 --> 00:01:09.127
<v><b>Hannah:</b></v> But what were you doing there I thought you were here, in the café, waiting for me.

00:01:09.904 --> 00:01:15.497
<v><b>Jamie:</b></v> I went to the theatre to buy these tickets for the Pink concert.

00:01:16.687 --> 00:01:17.707
I know you wanted to go.

00:01:17.708 --> 00:01:20.248
And it’s on the fifteenth of October – next Saturday.

00:01:21.195 --> 00:01:22.064
Our anniversary.

00:01:22.651 --> 00:01:23.600
<v><b>Hannah:</b></v> Our anniversary?

00:01:23.790 --> 00:01:26.377
<v><b>Jamie:</b></v> Yes. Three months since we first met.

00:01:26.769 --> 00:01:30.091
We met on Saturday the fifteenth of July. Remember?

00:01:32.945 --> 00:01:33.951
<v><b>Hannah:</b></v> Gosh, Jamie.

00:01:34.047 --> 00:01:36.240
I can’t believe you remember the exact day!

00:01:36.737 --> 00:01:42.843
What a romantic! It’s lucky I didn’t hit you in the street…